  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop Series - Southeast Asia Healthcare Workshop Series, through Blueprint Creative Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting a series of six (6) Southeast Asia Healthcare Workshops to provide a broad range of policy focused education and training to healthcare stakeholders from Southeast Asian countries, with an emphasis on USTDA&apos;s priority markets: Indonesia, Malaysia, Philippines, Thailand, and Vietnam. The workshops will serve as a forum where representatives from U.S. industry and government can engage Southeast Asian counterparts to collaborate on best practices, laws, regulations, standards, and policy development for the region&apos;s healthcare industry.</narrative>
  </description>
